          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: слушать",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "слушать (slúshat) — \"to listen\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "слушать (slúshat) from Proto-Slavic slušati, built on слух, \"hearing\" — inherited. Vasmer relates it to Lithuanian klausýti, \"to listen\", and Old High German hlosēn, \"to listen\"; English listen is a cousin, from PIE ḱlew-, \"to hear\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
